<description>&lt;p&gt;Venezuela disclosed a $237.5 billion debt pile and is advancing a large restructuring while the United States signed a security cooperation pact with the interim Venezuelan government, after which a U.S. marine died falling overboard during a Caribbean operation linked to the renewed ties. Senate investigations are probing JD Vance for allegedly steering a Venezuelan oil license to Vitol and another senator’s role in the same deal, and Citi is weighing a market re-entry after a five-year exit. Venezuelan authorities later declared the security pact null and void, illegal gold mining continues, and Eni and Repsol pledged a $2 billion joint-venture investment. According to UCDP, there were 2 battle-related deaths in 2007.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxNYnZ1a0tWZGRjN19GNkZNS0JoYmlDZGNHSkVZMmM1d2xsTEN1QmhsNkZtWVZfelZCUzdid05hSkVYa0hNVmpRazY0MUtWdWJQR2FydkFUeWtqZUotbXVvQ1JPVWg2Y0tGdWZOQ0hHUkNLRGh6Nm5SMjBNVldmRm1YZU1iaG5DSjdaSmFTcXpIdDZwUExwOFQzNWxSMk1QV1NaWWVONy02Y2FSa2xZbV8wUWMtd0h1clBxZ01aYTdpd0xYYjZMXzVrVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiU0FVX3lxTE9KcFExU3IzV0hqRVctRnF0cDJLUFFfN0hGRktMeVQyc0tmVUNrRHd5MVQ4R3RsVG1HS0xET0FjV0NnNU40RnYxLXR5bDhQMC1EczI4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxNSnBhS2YxRk5nTjRFbDJON0ROb19SVEYzc2dGYUpnb0ozdzV0Y2p2eHRjMVlYd3p3M09lam1qTHN2dkNhVDhsZmVvNUE3NXg3dFlCOWh4NUNzVXNqUmt4LVBDRFNCdDNGdlU0ak9hVTY1c1J4VXJ4a2stZndwbzE3b2QxLWxjMlJydmNkUlJDTTRDTmdDV21PS2hraVRUT0pLM29OLXJtZV9kaVhqTWlRc2tWM25tMFdNUnR0RXU3TQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxOakxRRS1xODNKVEMzdlowcjUzd2g4amNoV0JSSzdQc0JEUXg1WWxSbGxOaGhYWDZWSlQzeldBelpvUnpXb3g3bHdMUWd4NWhiZFJRZnEtSWU4TDBXS0Q1Q21CW